        <mxCell id="docs_refs" value="Documentation references&#10;&#10;Actual MVP:&#10;- orchestration/docs/json_orchestration_state_mvp.md&#10;- orchestration/docs/json_orchestration_state_mvp_v0_1_0_high_level_canvas.md&#10;- orchestration/docs/json_orchestration_state_mvp_v0_1_0_low_level_canvas.md&#10;&#10;Support docs:&#10;- operating model&#10;- MCP/skills plan&#10;- ask/reply artifact intake&#10;- native release lifecycle TODO&amp;#10;- Ask Reply JSON Data Flow page in this draw.io source&amp;#10;- docs/release-v0.1.26.md" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1040" y="1190" width="470" height="290" as="geometry" />
